# Source development: copy this file manually to this app root .env; never overwrite an existing file.
# 源码开发：手工复制到本应用根 .env；已有文件由Owner核对，不覆盖。
# Optional profile root: nonblank process > this .env > independent application default.
# 可选profile根：非空进程 > 本文件 > 独立应用默认；空值不是“新空目录”。
# Use an absolute literal path, without ~, $VAR, ${VAR} or parent traversal. First duplicate wins.
# 使用绝对字面路径，不展开变量；重复键首项生效。dev/build不自动隔离数据。
DAA_PROFILE_DIR=

# pnpm tauri dev includes the existing S7 driver; startup/reopen stays disconnected/stopped.
# PLC/group/point/storage configuration belongs to UI + SQLite; connect/collect in Workbench explicitly.
# 普通读取无需.env授权；旧DAA_PLC_READ_ALLOWED和YAML locator忽略，不再迁入示例PLC。
# 高级process DAA_PLC_READ_ALLOWED：缺失允许后续UI动作；false/空/非法/不可解码禁止。
# Advanced process-only absolute DAA_ENV_FILE selects another readable UTF-8 file; invalid selection fails.
# DAA_RUNTIME_MODE=legacy_snapshot in a selected file is ignored; the same process value is rejected.
# Legacy UTC/unknown profiles are preserved and refused; migration needs separate approval.
# Installed-package .env discovery/distribution is outside this source-development contract.
